          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='14'>Average Performance Heatmap</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='10'>Rows = Universities, Columns = Metrics (Normalized excluding University Score), Darker = Stronger relative performance</run>
